<p>Hello, <%= @resource.name.presence || @resource.email %>.</p>

<p>Someone requested a link to change your Fluxo password. You can do this through the link below.</p>

<p><%= link_to "Change my password", edit_password_url(@resource, reset_password_token: @token) %></p>

<p>If you did not request this, please ignore this email.</p>
<p>Your password will not change until you access the link above and create a new one.</p>
